The material world is identical across conditions — same repository snapshot, same tickets, same
seeded defects, same budgets, same tool costs, same audit. Only the normative structure differs.
Breach classification is computed from tool calls and world state, and an independent audit decides
whether the repository is acceptable, so neither agent's judgement defines ground truth.
